(14888, 357, 'message', 'I am a very disappointed and angry Ethis investor ! I have tried many times to get an update on my investment in the Container Phase 1 terminal project in 2017 which is in my opinion  a total disaster ! No one from Ethis has had the professional courtesy to reply to my previous requests for information nor replied to these emails. I tried your Singapore telephone number +6582502854 and I get a message \" this mobile cannot be reached\" I tried calling a Taufiq Aziz +65 3163 5278 (Singapore ) who had chased me for my Investment in 2017 !  This number was answered by a totally different company. It has been 4 years and I have received back even my basic investment, leave alone profits ! I have lost total confidence in Ethis. Please convey my displeasure to Mr Umar Munshi, he may be making money for others but ask him to return my Investment.  I await your reply. Please have the professional courtesy to reply to this email.', '2025-12-18 08:21:54', '2025-12-18 08:21:54'),
