(31273, 745, 'message', 'Peace Be Upon You.\n\nCongratulations on establishing a shariah crowdfunding platform. I\'m from Malaysia and very keen to invest but have few queries wandering in my head:\n\n1. How do EC tackle if there is legislation risk from the government (change of policy, change of the ruling party, cancelation of the project) for example what happened in Malaysia where most of the PR1MA housing project is postponed. What happens to the investment of the investors if such case occur? \n\n2. What happens if the project hits by a natural disaster? Is the project fully insured etc? \n\n3. The duration of the investment stated in the live campaign will start from when?\n\n4. Is the duration stated in the live campaign includes the payout to the investors? For example, if it is stated 10 months, can we expect the payout to be on the 11 months?\n\n5. What happens if the campaign fails to raise 100%, will be campaign still proceed for the investor that already invested and does it give any implication on the execution of the project, expected profit and duration? \n\n6. Looking in the Maybank2u options for transfer to Indonesia, they only provide USD, INR, and EUR. In this case, I need to choose USD, is it?   \n\n7. How does the payout being done to the investors? via cheque or TT?\n\nHope to hear from EC soon. I also can be contacted at the tel no given.\n\nThanks.', '2025-12-18 08:21:59', '2025-12-18 08:21:59'),
