(31616, 753, 'message', 'Assalamu\'alaikum\nDear Ethis Ventures Team.\n\nMy name is Muhammad Syauqi Bin Armia, I\'m MBA in Islamic Banking and Finance from UK and holding the AAOIFI\'s CSAA (Certified Shariah Advisor and Auditor).\nI\'m working now at IFAAS UK (Islamic Finance Advisory and Assurance Service) in Sharia assistance and Product Development team. I looking for a new career shift at Ethis due to its values offered to the clients. \nI did apply to the position for Business Development at Ethis Ventures websites. unfortunately, I made some mistakes in term of my availability period to work and the Salary expectation. Could suggest me what should I do to my case, please?\n\nI deeply appreciate your response.\n\nBest regards, \nMuhammad Syauqi Bin Armia', '2025-12-18 08:21:59', '2025-12-18 08:21:59'),
