(33137, 788, 'message', 'Hi, \nI am very disappointed at Ethis for their lack of updates for the project Pesona Alam Dramaga. I have tried to reach out to the team via whatsapp and I have been referred to and ignored by the team. I am an investor who would like to get my money back or at least get some updates on the investment. The lack of replies from ethis has been really disappointing and unprofessional. \n\nThe project was supposed to end more than a year ago and it has not. I understand that projects may have delays due to various reasons. This however does not warrant a total lack of care from ethis to their investors.', '2025-12-18 08:21:59', '2025-12-18 08:21:59'),
