(33956, 806, 'message', 'Subject: Inquiry Regarding P2P Finance Application for Innovative Crypto Trading App\n\nDear Ethis X Team,\n\nI hope this email finds you well. My name is HASSAN EL YAKOUBI, and I am reaching out on behalf of SUNSET GATE TO OPERATE THE SITES W.L.L, a recently established technology company based in Bahrain. I am writing to inquire about the possibility of applying for P2P finance through your platform to support the development and promotion of our innovative crypto trading mobile app.\n\nOur company has been diligently working on a groundbreaking mobile app designed for crypto trading. We are excited to share that the app is nearing completion, with approximately 70% of the development process already accomplished. Leveraging the power of AI and machine learning, our app has been intelligently designed to provide a cutting-edge user experience in the crypto trading landscape. However, as a new entrant in the market, we are currently facing financial constraints that are impeding our ability to fully realize the app\'s potential.\n\nThe primary objective of seeking P2P finance is to secure the necessary funds to initiate a robust advertising and promotional campaign for our app. We firmly believe that our app\'s integration of AI and machine learning sets it apart, allowing it to offer unique insights and functionalities to users.\n\nGiven our current status as a new company, we acknowledge that we do not yet have an established income or revenue stream. We understand that this might impact our eligibility for certain traditional financing avenues. However, we are keen to explore the possibility of obtaining P2P finance through your platform, as we believe in the disruptive potential of our app and its ability to attract users and generate revenue in the near future.\n\nTo proceed with the application process, could you please provide guidance on the specific requirements and documentation needed from our end? We are committed to providing any necessary information to showcase our app\'s potential and our dedication to its success.\n\nThank you for considering our inquiry. We look forward to the opportunity to discuss the potential collaboration further and to present our app and business plan in detail. Please let us know the appropriate next steps or any additional information you require from us.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nHASSAN EL YAKOUBI\nFounder CEO', '2025-12-18 08:22:00', '2025-12-18 08:22:00'),
