(52874, 1246, 'message', 'As salaam alikum.\nI have glanced at your website and found interesting opportunities. However, I have a couple of questions. I would appreciate if you could take time to answer each of it.\n\nI would like to know whether all the investment opportunities listed in Ethis is Sharia compliant? Also, is there anyway we can keep monitoring that? Also if I like would I be able to sell my investments? How do I know whether my investment took place and my percentage of my share? How to withdraw the profits?\nIs there any portal where I can view the details?\nI am a Maldivian and is there any restriction on withdrawing money to my bank account in Maldives other than transaction fees?\nAre you the manager of my capital or how does this go about?\n\nWould appreciate if you could respond to my email :)\n\nBest regards\n\nMohamed Vishah', '2025-12-18 08:22:05', '2025-12-18 08:22:05'),
