(53875, 1270, 'full_name', 'Noraisha binti Yusuf', '2025-12-18 08:22:06', '2025-12-18 08:22:06'),
(53876, 1270, 'last_contacted', '44977.859722222', '2025-12-18 08:22:06', '2025-12-18 08:22:06'),
(53877, 1270, 'legal_basis_for_processing_contacts_data', 'Legitimate interest - prospect/lead', '2025-12-18 08:22:06', '2025-12-18 08:22:06'),
(53878, 1270, 'lifecycle_stage', 'Sales Qualified Lead', '2025-12-18 08:22:06', '2025-12-18 08:22:06'),
(53879, 1270, 'message', 'Assalamualaikum,\n\nIt would be interesting if the Ethis platform could facilitate written Q&A between potential investors and issuers. \n\nThe information provided for each campaign has been most useful. But the level of details provided between campaigns are not standardized e.g. some showing their past financial performance and others don\'t, some do not explain the business history in details to justify their revenue & sales performance. Having sales & revenue forecast as the main point can be misleading. \n\nI may not be as confident in investing due to the lack of understanding, especially if it is a new industry (to issuer).\n\nI understand that is not Ethis role to advice us on what constitute as good investment. But what would be helpful is If there\'s a systematic, easy way for us to leave our questions, and get answers and clarification from issuers on the campaign page.\n\nAppreciate your consideration and guidance on this. Thank you\n\nRegards,\nAisha', '2025-12-18 08:22:06', '2025-12-18 08:22:06'),
